{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-10-34","kind":"proposition","title":"构造与求解：不可公度量与可公度量与中项无理线段","englishTitle":"To find two straight lines incommensurable in square which make the sum of the squares on them medial but the rectangle contained by them rational.","book":10,"number":34,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.34","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.34/","group":"prop_1","sourceNumber":34,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-10-34@raw-7843f893a0e76717","contentId":"euclid-10-34","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"7843f893a0e767175c1e8b8689682edfa3a8d7a5ac099fd56ac530ae8b2af6de","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-10-34.statement","euclid-10-34.construction.1","euclid-10-34.construction.2","euclid-10-34.proof.1","euclid-10-34.proof.2","euclid-10-34.proof.3","euclid-10-34.proof.4","euclid-10-34.proof.5","euclid-10-34.proof.6","euclid-10-34.conclusion","euclid-10-34.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-10-34.statement","contentId":"euclid-10-34","revisionId":"euclid-10-34@raw-7843f893a0e76717","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2de6f0dabc8c93e64fad1ba23876664078c260850a70e0d212306bb161c07b9c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"To find two straight lines incommensurable in square which make the sum of the squares on them medial but the rectangle contained by them rational."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"找到正方形的不可公度线 这两条直线 总共正方形 却由有理直线组成；这里涉及中项无理量。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-34.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-10-34","revisionId":"euclid-10-34@raw-7843f893a0e76717","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a55673538a7071eb03113cea25e07b237fd0c9f965b264f4fd998e0c7d78ae6c","citations":["euclid-10-31","euclid-6-28","euclid-10-18"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let there be set out two medial straight lines AB, BC, commensurable in square only, such that the rectangle which they contain is rational, and the square on AB is greater than the square on BC by the square on a straight line incommensurable with AB; [[X. 31](/principles/euclid-10-31), ad fin.] let the semicircle ADB be described on AB, let BC be bisected at E, let there be applied to AB a parallelogram equal to the square on BE and deficient by a square figure, namely the rectangle AF, FB; [[VI. 28](/principles/euclid-6-28)] therefore AF is incommensurable in length with FB. [[X. 18](/principles/euclid-10-18)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"取两条仅在平方上可公度的中项无理线段 AB、BC，使以它们为边的矩形面积为有理面积，并使 AB 的平方比 BC 的平方大，差额等于与 AB 不可公度的线段的平方。以 AB 为直径作半圆 ADB，在 E 点平分 BC，再在 AB 上作面积等于 BE 平方、并缺少一个正方形的平行四边形，即以 AF、FB 为边的矩形；因此 AF 与 FB 在长度上不可公度。 [X. 31](/principles/euclid-10-31) [[VI. 28](/principles/euclid-6-28)] [[X. 18](/principles/euclid-10-18)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-34.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-10-34","revisionId":"euclid-10-34@raw-7843f893a0e76717","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9be711dd562d83dc614fb3c21e2c25ece3a6c17f7d9e5e513c47c03641047ee7","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let FD be drawn from F at right angles to AB, and let AD, DB be joined."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让FD从直角到AB之间抽取,让AD和DB连接起来。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-34.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-10-34","revisionId":"euclid-10-34@raw-7843f893a0e76717","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a538325887509e2d5f32f4795fb92d26c78fe01180f9d2498371a80ba3016e39","citations":["euclid-10-11"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Since AF is incommensurable in length with FB, therefore the rectangle BA, AF is also incommensurable with the rectangle AB, BF. [[X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由于AF长不可公度,FB,因此,矩形BA,AF,不可公度,矩形AB,BF。 [[X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-34.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-10-34","revisionId":"euclid-10-34@raw-7843f893a0e76717","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2bfbe57854623601dd763808d7afb4c068a48ad5c735f26e4425b3b29fea0740","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the rectangle BA, AF is equal to the square on AD, and the rectangle AB, BF to the square on DB; therefore the square on AD is also incommensurable with the square on DB."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,矩形 BA,AF等于AD,矩形 AB,BF至正方形,DB;因此,AD,正方形,不可公度,正方形,DB。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-34.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-10-34","revisionId":"euclid-10-34@raw-7843f893a0e76717","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c7044c0edbec7a5eaf2c10a7d2c29222139745389aa7f98ce476a1a84c15f2a6","citations":["euclid-3-31","euclid-1-47"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since the square on AB is medial, therefore the sum of the squares on AD, DB is also medial. [[III. 31](/principles/euclid-3-31), [I. 47](/principles/euclid-1-47)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AB正方形中项无理线段, AD正方形ADDB中项无理线段 [ [III. 31](/principles/euclid-3-31) [I. 47](/principles/euclid-1-47)"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-34.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-10-34","revisionId":"euclid-10-34@raw-7843f893a0e76717","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6d6aff7e729bcbfe9165d13a7fdf3a48480b87bb1cf065b6a5caf52348b73832","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since BC is double of DF, therefore the rectangle AB, BC is also double of the rectangle AB, FD."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"BC是DF的两倍 所以矩形 AB BC也是矩形 AB FD的两倍"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-34.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-10-34","revisionId":"euclid-10-34@raw-7843f893a0e76717","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1187d6ed576b28a7b2ac1373394603fe11eac4aaa6957b1fe42b2cb53658d4f2","citations":["euclid-10-6"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the rectangle AB, BC is rational; therefore the rectangle AB, FD is also rational. [[X. 6](/principles/euclid-10-6)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是矩形 AB,BC是有理,矩形 AB,FD也是有理。 [[X. 6](/principles/euclid-10-6)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-34.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-10-34","revisionId":"euclid-10-34@raw-7843f893a0e76717","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"93478c0596e0adef65da22da54e9577161b6bbe451a42887467e77695ae6e78c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the rectangle AB, FD is equal to the rectangle AD, DB; [Lemma] so that the rectangle AD, DB is also rational."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是矩形 AB,FD等于矩形 AD,DB;[引理],矩形 AD,DB也是有理。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-34.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-10-34","revisionId":"euclid-10-34@raw-7843f893a0e76717","order":9,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5b34b4c11ec0556b615c0b9b92015857e6c707ae8ade92110283e2f6bc177a36","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore two straight lines AD, DB incommensurable in square have been found which make the sum of the squares on them medial, but the rectangle contained by them rational. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,在正方形中发现两条直线AD、DB、不可公度,中项无理线段,中项无理线段,正方形,中项无理线段,矩形,有理。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-34.source","contentId":"euclid-10-34","revisionId":"euclid-10-34@raw-7843f893a0e76717","order":10,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0dfc77513fed029439f7b73b42bba19e32a669c95f08aec2e34e5149503e8d8a","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.34/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.34\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-10-34:euclid-10-31:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-34","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-34.construction.1"],"targetContentId":"euclid-10-31","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.34","sourceUrl":"